{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19991","headline":"寒溪 四 · 孟郊","name":"寒溪 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"篙工磓玉星，一路随迸萤。\n朔冻哀彻底，獠馋咏潜鯹。\n冰齿相磨啮，风音酸铎铃。\n清悲不可逃，洗出纤悉听。\n碧潋卷已尽，彩缕飞飘零。\n下蹑滑不定，上栖折难停。\n哮嘐呷喢冤，仰诉何时宁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19991.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19991","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}